<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO auction raises total 27.9 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO auction raises total 27.9 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details of the outcome of its monthly government bond auction -</p>
<p>4.00 pct, Jan 2000 OLO</p>
<p>    Payment					 29/05</p>
<p>    Stop (lowest accepted) price	    99.75</p>
<p>    Amount allotted			     10.65 billion francs</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop		  23.3</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield		99.782  / 4.081 pct</p>
<p>    Amount allotted at non-comp auction   2.83 billion *</p>
<p>6.25 pct March 2007 OLO</p>
<p>    Payment					 29/05</p>
<p>    Stop (lowest accepted) price	    101.75</p>
<p>    Amount allotted			     13.05 billion</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop		  62.7</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield		101.75  / 6.006 pct</p>
<p>    Amount allotted at non-comp auction   1.37 billion *</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
